    <researchPrerequisite>MUGB_Research_Fleshcraft</researchPrerequisite>
    <label>extract heart</label>
    <description>Rip out the heart in a crude goblin butchery operation. Success is certain and yields a prepared goblin cooking heart, but the patient does not survive.</description>
